<div class="quote-band">
  <div class="quote-inner">
    <div class="quote-line"></div>
    <div class="quote-text" id="quote-text">
      "Growth is more about courage than knowledge."
    </div>
    <div class="quote-cn" lang="zh">成长更多关乎勇气，而非知识</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .quote-band {
    background: var(--parchment);
    border-top: 1px solid #DDD8CE;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #DDD8CE;
    padding: 64px 40px;
  }

  .quote-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .quote-line {
    width: 36px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--terra);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--deep);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .quote-cn {
    font-family: var(--font-cn-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--espresso);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
</style>
